  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BUILDING CAPACITY FOR AN EFFECTIVE SEA TURTLE CONSERVATION PROGRAM IN THE KINGDOM OF MOROCCO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PURPOSE OF THIS PROJECT IS TO PROTECT IMPORTANT LOGGERHEAD FORAGING POPULATIONS IN MOROCCAN WATERS AND REMNANT SEA TURTLE NESTING POPULATIONS IN MOROCCO. THE RECIPIENT WILL 1. CONDUCT AN EXTENSIVE QUESTIONNAIRE SURVEY OF FISHERMAN FROM THE CENTRAL AND SOUTHERN MOROCCAN COASTLINE TO DETERMINE HISTORIC AND PRESENT SEA TURTLE NESTINGACTIVITY 2. WORK WITH FISHERMAN AND DIRECT OBSERVERS TO ASSESS AND MITIGATE SEA TURTLE BYCATCH IN TRAWL, SEINE AND LONGLINE FISHERIES 3. CARRY OUT OUTREACH AND EDUCATION CAMPAIGNS IN SCHOOLS AND UNIVERSITIES AND 4. AND ORGANIZE THE 7TH MEDITERRANEAN CONFERENCE ON MARINE TURTLES IN MOROCCO.</narrative>
  </description>
